 <title>Three adaptive landscapes</title>
 <link>https://coveredinbees.org.archived.website/3adaptivelandscapes</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;Three communities I&#039;ve come across in the last few years have made me see language and order in a new way. Two I&#039;ve read about - Peruvian potato farmers and Balinese rice-growers. The other  - &lt;a href=&quot;//www.visitnsw.com/town/Broken_Hill/Mutawintji_National_Park/info.aspx&quot;&gt;Mutawintji&lt;/a&gt; - I visited as a tourist on an Outback safari before the PhD started. I&#039;ll get all my caveats out of the way: no in-depth knowledge of any of these; it&#039;ll seem like a pretty functionalist argument; I know almost nothing about anthropology. Given that…&lt;/p&gt;
